     * Returns one page of the customers matching {@code filter}.
     *
     * <p>The filter is applied here, in the backend: the offset and the limit
     * count matching rows only, so a caller paging through a filtered list
     * never sees the rows the filter hides.
     *
     * @param filter which customers to consider, never {@code null}
     * @param offset zero-based index of the first matching row to return
     * @param limit  maximum number of rows to return, at most {@link #MAX_PAGE_SIZE}
     * @param sorts  sort instructions, applied in order; may be empty
